[867]={["atomIDs"]={"867:description:1-73","867:description:75-144","867:description:149-216","867:description:218-345","867:description:350-478","867:description:480-509","867:objective:1-27","867:objective:32-83"},["opening"]="Darsok had studied the Witchwing hierarchy after repeated caravan raids. He began with the lower ranks, intending to work upward toward their leaders.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to collect eight Witchwing talons.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the talons to Darsok.",["sourceHash"]="d2e5aef25236e12e33954c5eb13e4e164631100c95ebee7b4f33790c657a0b72",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[868]={["atomIDs"]={"868:description:1-8","868:description:10-122","868:description:127-223","868:description:225-300","868:description:302-372","868:description:377-507","868:objective:1-72"},["opening"]="Korran studied the unusual intelligence of the insects in the Field of Giants. Eggs from their mounds might help, but disturbed creatures would defend them.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to gather silithid eggs and return the digging claw.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the eggs and tool to Korran.",["sourceHash"]="c5eb151d8b55dad72f2e0ba62bf67dd976b568ad873e41155b4d384ed645bffa",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[869]={["atomIDs"]={"869:description:1-67","869:description:70-149","869:description:154-176","869:description:178-232","869:description:235-240","869:description:242-257","869:description:260-272","869:description:277-325","869:description:328-405","869:description:410-437","869:description:440-466","869:objective:1-50"},["opening"]="A captured thief proved to be a raptor after silver vanished from the guard tower. Gazrog wanted the raiders stopped, though their interest in payroll remained unexplained.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring twelve raptor heads to Gazrog.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the requested heads to Gazrog.",["sourceHash"]="d615920b451deec3742a1ce49a944be1da6ac97a525842f6e95dbae4e2ea449d",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[870]={["aftermath"]="Tonga treated the bubbling fissure as a clue, while leaving its connection to the oases unresolved.",["atomIDs"]={"870:description:1-58","870:description:61-141","870:description:144-194","870:description:199-282","870:description:285-354","870:description:359-382","870:description:385-443","870:description:446-503","870:objective:1-50"},["bridge"]="Tonga's search began with a contradiction in the dry country. New oases had formed where war and cataclysm had left a husk, and he sensed something beneath them that might explain the returning life.",["bridgeAtomIDs"]={"870:description:1-58","870:description:61-141","870:description:144-194","870:description:199-282","870:description:285-354","870:description:359-382","870:description:385-443","870:description:446-503","870:objective:1-50"},["bridgeFrom"]=886,["bridgeMinimumStage"]=2,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["bridgeSourceHash"]="8c5577974efcdd2a8211b4da6b215fc3213c995034915637cd58aa669965a87a",["endingAtomIDs"]={"870:completion:1-62","870:completion:64-71","870:completion:73-138","870:completion:143-159","870:completion:161-196"},["opening"]="New oases interrupted the Barrens' long desolation. Tonga sensed power rising beneath them and sought its source in the waters of the Forgotten Pools.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to investigate the pools for Tonga.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported the findings from the Forgotten Pools.",["sourceHash"]="8c5577974efcdd2a8211b4da6b215fc3213c995034915637cd58aa669965a87a",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[873]={["atomIDs"]={"873:description:1-44","873:description:47-90","873:description:93-167","873:description:172-193","873:description:196-220","873:description:223-267","873:description:272-343","873:description:348-421","873:objective:1-47"},["opening"]="Mahren regarded Isha Awak as honorable prey despite the coastal humans' fear of him. She offered the great water beast as a hunter's next challenge.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Isha Awak's heart to Mahren.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the heart to Mahren.",["sourceHash"]="d4f43c346e57958f4dd550602beb02ce8a02467ff63dfa445c0e097eae0cccf6",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[874]={["atomIDs"]={"874:description:1-42","874:description:45-66","874:description:69-105","874:description:108-150","874:description:153-198","874:description:203-219","874:description:224-246","874:description:249-297","874:description:300-338","874:description:343-419","874:objective:1-26"},["opening"]="Jorn broadened the hunter's path from land to sea. His sister Mahren taught along a coast where human occupation made the search dangerous.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to find Mahren along the coast.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} met Mahren for the next hunting lesson.",["sourceHash"]="600ab2087beac4dc6881056658fcd236ee24e24e778828fd68545a6a806f9ced",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[875]={["atomIDs"]={"875:description:1-11","875:description:13-26","875:description:28-53","875:description:58-140","875:description:142-236","875:description:238-311","875:description:313-384","875:description:389-421","875:description:423-502","875:objective:1-112"},["bridge"]="The campaign next reached the command ranks in the Dry Hills. Rings would identify the Witchwing Slayers serving as lieutenants.",["bridgeFrom"]=867,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="Darsok moved his campaign into the Dry Hills' command ranks. Rings identified the Witchwing Slayers serving as lieutenants among the harpies.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover six lieutenant rings.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the rings to Darsok.",["sourceHash"]="3a71ea03d3d77662114444a57dbf248acaa7cff9dd4457bef23dbd9f8214a0de",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[876]={["atomIDs"]={"876:description:1-98","876:description:103-208","876:description:210-292","876:description:297-353","876:description:355-407","876:description:409-452","876:objective:1-85"},["bridge"]="Darsok attributed the raids to Serena Bloodfeather's revenge for her sister. He wanted the leader confronted and proof brought back as a warning to later raiders.",["bridgeFrom"]=875,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="Darsok attributed the caravan raids to Serena's revenge for a sister slain by Rexxar. He now targeted the leader and wanted her head displayed to later raiders.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to confront Serena and recover her head.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Serena's head to Darsok.",["sourceHash"]="9a71bbfb0cef25c45d97f3db47ab26a22888a7bb8535bf386f356a121fc42ee6",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[877]={["aftermath"]="Tonga interpreted the revived seeds as evidence of extraordinary life-giving power and called for further study.",["atomIDs"]={"877:description:1-103","877:description:106-168","877:description:173-190","877:description:195-217","877:description:220-301","877:description:304-377","877:objective:1-74"},["bridge"]="The first fissure gave Tonga another question to test. Dead seeds placed at the next oasis might show whether such openings were the source of its life.",["bridgeAtomIDs"]={"877:description:1-103","877:description:106-168","877:description:173-190","877:description:195-217","877:description:220-301","877:description:304-377","877:objective:1-74"},["bridgeFrom"]=870,["bridgeMinimumStage"]=2,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["bridgeSourceHash"]="47983cff1a1d488c583e01d6b8cd6dad527cebb73faf7745fe083ea607067419",["endingAtomIDs"]={"877:completion:1-26","877:completion:28-69","877:completion:71-132","877:completion:137-162"},["opening"]="Tonga proposed testing whether fissures sustained the oases. Dead seeds placed beneath the Stagnant Oasis might reveal what its hidden power could do.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to test Tonga's seeds at the oasis.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned with the results of the seed experiment.",["sourceHash"]="47983cff1a1d488c583e01d6b8cd6dad527cebb73faf7745fe083ea607067419",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[878]={["aftermath"]="Mangletooth's satisfaction gave way to bitterness that his own tribe had left him imprisoned.",["atomIDs"]={"878:description:1-27","878:description:29-110","878:description:112-175","878:description:177-221","878:description:223-237","878:description:242-347","878:description:349-482","878:objective:1-149"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"878:completion:1-11","878:completion:13-93","878:completion:95-154","878:completion:159-197","878:completion:199-247","878:completion:249-277","878:completion:279-323","878:completion:328-399"},["opening"]="Mangletooth offered help against the Horde's troubles by asking for aid against his own rivals. He identified Bristleback spiritual leaders as the source of their strength.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to confront the Bristleback spiritual leaders.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Mangletooth's assignment against the Bristlebacks.",["sourceHash"]="1f832f75205595b41422b8924547f9d4786c20ec5965f49fa9465c845bbf954f",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[879]={["aftermath"]="Mangletooth accepted the outcome as revenge for his abandonment, then identified one remaining task.",["atomIDs"]={"879:description:1-80","879:description:82-213","879:description:215-256","879:description:258-264","879:description:269-316","879:description:318-359","879:description:361-462","879:description:464-503","879:objective:1-100"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"879:completion:1-16","879:completion:18-59","879:completion:61-206","879:completion:211-259"},["opening"]="Mangletooth named Nak, Kuz and Lok as leaders of raids from the Kraul. He turned against members of the tribe that abandoned him.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring the three raiders' skulls to Mangletooth.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the skulls of Nak, Kuz and Lok.",["sourceHash"]="29be981d25e1810348411823f818f9d1cbd079f370c87ffd80e99988b8d77c89",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[880]={["atomIDs"]={"880:description:1-33","880:description:36-101","880:description:104-128","880:description:133-223","880:description:228-283","880:description:286-329","880:objective:1-68"},["bridge"]="The oases' strange properties now had to be traced through the creatures drinking from them. Tonga wanted shells from snapjaws at Lushwater and the Stagnant Oasis to learn what the water was doing.",["bridgeAtomIDs"]={"880:description:1-33","880:description:36-101","880:description:104-128","880:description:133-223","880:description:228-283","880:description:286-329","880:objective:1-68"},["bridgeFrom"]=877,["bridgeMinimumStage"]=2,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["bridgeSourceHash"]="8fc1dc00613ef4cae327b7f3f3d94a91abab2a3fc163ee7eeb591c5cedfeb7c9",["independentReviewRevision"]="r2-findings-applied-2026-10-26",["opening"]="Tonga turned from water and seeds to the animals drinking at the oases. Snapjaw shells might reveal how the unexplained power changed living creatures.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather eight altered snapjaw shells.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied Tonga with the shells for study.",["sourceHash"]="8fc1dc00613ef4cae327b7f3f3d94a91abab2a3fc163ee7eeb591c5cedfeb7c9",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
