[882]={["atomIDs"]={"882:description:1-71","882:description:74-114","882:description:117-156","882:description:159-200","882:description:205-301","882:description:306-320","882:description:323-417","882:description:420-472","882:description:477-499","882:objective:1-48"},["opening"]="Jorn sent the hunt toward a dead tree near Ratchet. A zhevra carcass should draw the fierce raptor from its roaming path.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to lure Ishamuhale and recover his fang.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Ishamuhale's fang to Jorn.",["sourceHash"]="5e771b9aa8e08e6549e3319ebd66a2171cb305ee27ab065ecee9ada8560bbb30",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[883]={["aftermath"]="Jorn named the kodo Earthshaker and honored its courage through the token.",["atomIDs"]={"883:description:1-70","883:objective:1-54"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"883:completion:1-91","883:completion:93-147","883:completion:149-194","883:completion:199-212","883:completion:214-236"},["opening"]="The great kodo's hoof stood as a token of its strength. Jorn at Camp Taurajo was the intended recipient of that evidence.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to carry Lakota'mani's hoof to Jorn.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the hoof at Camp Taurajo.",["sourceHash"]="ef016b8a395a2adeda4454dc5dd76d53bbcc78502d7d75c42de2d9d6f8f7d76b",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[884]={["aftermath"]="Jorn called the beast Bluebolt and recounted a tradition that lightning gave it unbounded energy.",["atomIDs"]={"884:description:1-56","884:objective:1-51"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"884:completion:1-114","884:completion:116-238","884:completion:243-278","884:completion:280-315"},["opening"]="Sparks flew when the thunder lizard's tailspike was touched. The unusual remnant could be carried to Jorn at Camp Taurajo.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Owatanka's tailspike to Jorn.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the sparking tailspike.",["sourceHash"]="92982a07df7cc638ada2beec557a901a9847b9256f3aa7eda68a7de6a04cb3cc",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[885]={["aftermath"]="Jorn interpreted Spirit Biter through a lesson about gains and costs: regret could turn to wisdom, and pain could teach strength.",["atomIDs"]={"885:description:1-52","885:objective:1-61"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"885:completion:1-103","885:completion:108-177","885:completion:179-186","885:completion:191-291","885:completion:293-333","885:completion:338-375","885:completion:377-463","885:completion:468-493"},["opening"]="The thunderhawk's feather caused pain on contact. Jorn was the one to receive this strange token at Camp Taurajo.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring Washte Pawne's feather to Jorn.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the painful feather to Jorn.",["sourceHash"]="31196f8f3048f8da1ffd1e32367005897329de0f49df5d6a4b0f98dd12dbc875",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[886]={["atomIDs"]={"886:description:1-92","886:description:97-188","886:description:193-235","886:description:238-266","886:description:269-328","886:description:331-385","886:description:388-436","886:description:441-503","886:objective:1-45"},["opening"]="Thunder Bluff's druids sensed unfamiliar power entering the Barrens. Hamuul sought help for Tonga's investigation at the Crossroads.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to join Tonga's inquiry into the oases.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached Tonga at the Crossroads.",["sourceHash"]="abc2a96af52b194c04af390558bb2614353021dd9c022babbb454f8d9fba6d98",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[887]={["atomIDs"]={"887:description:1-100","887:description:102-271","887:description:276-351","887:description:353-474","887:objective:1-75"},["opening"]="Gazlowe's ships kept losing cargo to pirates despite the trade fleets' expense. A Freebooter camp south of Ratchet gave him a target for retaliation.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to confront the Southsea force south of Ratchet.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Gazlowe's assignment against the Freebooters.",["sourceHash"]="079db2b0cffad3c255b5b326de75d0b2bc8af802952c5a7f6fe3cdf9fb186165",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[888]={["atomIDs"]={"888:description:1-69","888:description:71-126","888:description:131-216","888:description:218-312","888:description:314-375","888:description:380-437","888:objective:1-74"},["bridge"]="Gazlowe narrowed the search to goods he could not afford to lose: the smaller lens for his observatory and a shipment of boots. Those were the essentials he wanted brought back from the pirate camp.",["bridgeAtomIDs"]={"888:description:1-69","888:description:71-126","888:description:131-216","888:description:218-312","888:description:314-375","888:description:380-437","888:objective:1-74"},["bridgeFrom"]=892,["bridgeMinimumStage"]=2,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["bridgeSourceHash"]="6fe2f834d510609a1ad680e23bac240fd3def2871e6580e596e0fa8cc4dcbd68",["opening"]="Gazlowe could not recover every stolen good, but two shipments mattered most: boots from Booty Bay and the missing lens for his observatory.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover the boots and telescope lens.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned both shipments to Gazlowe.",["sourceHash"]="6fe2f834d510609a1ad680e23bac240fd3def2871e6580e596e0fa8cc4dcbd68",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[889]={["atomIDs"]={"889:requestItems:1-72","889:requestItems:74-134","889:requestItems:139-227"},["coverageQualification"]="BASIC_RETAINED_EXCHANGE_CONTEXT",["minimumStage"]=3,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring ten blood shards to Mangletooth.",["opening"]="Mangletooth offered a fleeting blessing of speed in exchange for ten blood shards. The gift was intended to ease travel through the Barrens, rather than last forever.",["pending"]="{actor} would exchange ten blood shards with Mangletooth.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought ten blood shards to Mangletooth.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_REVIEWED_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="a29dc53d123ba063ae30aa10bcfdcbe9f2d4e2ab43efaa3d8bce478066a11eb7",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentPlayability","unlistedQuantities"}},
[890]={["atomIDs"]={"890:description:1-71","890:description:73-279","890:description:284-385","890:objective:1-47"},["bridge"]="Gazlowe suspected the Freebooters had stolen his overdue goods, but first wanted to rule out a mistake at the docks. Dizzywig was to compare the ledger with his logs and check whether the shipment had already reached the warehouse.",["bridgeAtomIDs"]={"890:description:1-71","890:description:73-279","890:description:284-385","890:objective:1-47"},["bridgeFrom"]=887,["bridgeMinimumStage"]=2,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["bridgeSourceHash"]="410d660c1c1808fcbfb1b7bc284a680256ca73eaf349e766f00626905b4a7046",["independentReviewRevision"]="r2-findings-applied-2026-10-26",["opening"]="Gazlowe suspected piracy but first wanted the warehouse records checked. His ledger had to be compared with Dizzywig's logs at the docks.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to have Dizzywig inspect the shipment records.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Gazlowe's ledger to Dizzywig.",["sourceHash"]="410d660c1c1808fcbfb1b7bc284a680256ca73eaf349e766f00626905b4a7046",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[891]={["aftermath"]="Brightsun said the guns had been silenced and turned to recovering the dead.",["atomIDs"]={"891:description:1-92","891:description:97-130","891:description:132-176","891:description:178-248","891:description:253-332","891:description:334-380","891:description:382-465","891:objective:1-148"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"891:completion:1-53","891:completion:55-93","891:completion:98-166"},["opening"]="Brightsun reported another fleet vessel lost to Northwatch's guns. He sought medals and action against Fairmount's command to stop the attacks on shipping.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to confront Northwatch's leaders and gather medals.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled Brightsun's Northwatch assignment.",["sourceHash"]="d8d6e96b6b803fc134a5259e9e9db30088996459b84fc26fd4be36bff5b26004",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[892]={["atomIDs"]={"892:description:1-44","892:description:46-90","892:description:92-161","892:description:166-195","892:description:203-320","892:objective:1-46"},["bridge"]="Dizzywig found his records in order. The ledger was to return to Gazlowe with little hope for the missing goods, leaving the freebooters as the likely explanation.",["bridgeAtomIDs"]={"892:description:1-44","892:description:46-90","892:description:92-161","892:description:166-195","892:description:203-320","892:objective:1-46"},["bridgeFrom"]=890,["bridgeMinimumStage"]=2,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["bridgeSourceHash"]="97e3db419c0eb203bdb701c9b51a3546ba651a40700c7e2d1d4df67e4377ae60",["opening"]="Dizzywig's records showed no misplaced delivery. He sent the ledger back with his suspicion that pirates took the missing goods.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to return the checked ledger to Gazlowe.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Dizzywig's findings to Gazlowe.",["sourceHash"]="97e3db419c0eb203bdb701c9b51a3546ba651a40700c7e2d1d4df67e4377ae60",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[893]={["aftermath"]="The samples exceeded Tatternack's expectations and led him to warn against underestimating the quilboar.",["atomIDs"]={"893:description:1-174","893:description:176-263","893:description:268-353","893:description:355-451","893:description:453-474","893:objective:1-139"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"893:completion:1-38","893:completion:43-93","893:completion:98-139","893:completion:141-187","893:completion:189-281"},["opening"]="Reports of sturdier Razormane weapons troubled Tatternack. A dagger, wand and shield would let the smith study an enemy thought to lack skilled metalworkers.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover three examples of Razormane arms.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the weapon samples to Tatternack.",["sourceHash"]="006eeb936ccb97a403dd3cf017f4c6c563def47dc5e472e316e9455b8f566116",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[894]={["aftermath"]="The console showed three open valves and a small keyhole among its controls.",["atomIDs"]={"894:description:1-107","894:description:109-249","894:description:254-288","894:description:290-364","894:description:369-502","894:objective:1-64"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"894:completion:1-117","894:completion:119-278","894:completion:280-355"},["opening"]="Sputtervalve knew little about the company's northern experiment except its name. A copied operating manual offered a way into the research site's controls.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to access the company's control console.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached the research apparatus's console.",["sourceHash"]="512d640a04d23a32695c5547dd2ca7440998d9528de7bf508d038e43491351e0",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[895]={["atomIDs"]={"895:description:1-7","895:description:12-51","895:description:56-162","895:description:164-205","895:description:210-219","895:objective:1-56"},["opening"]="Gazlowe's bounty named Longshore as a Gilnean captain leading Freebooter vessels. The notice demanded identifiable remains as evidence of the pirate's death.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to claim the bounty on Longshore.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Longshore's head to Gazlowe.",["sourceHash"]="26c1d2c477ec429600bdde59ac1abd5e1034c0448bc4eb9946ab9ac13f26f95b",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[896]={["atomIDs"]={"896:description:1-92","896:description:94-169","896:description:174-284","896:description:286-347","896:description:349-486","896:objective:1-57","896:objective:59-117"},["opening"]="News from Boulder Lode told of a fist-sized emerald. Dizzywig knew potential buyers and proposed sharing the proceeds if the stone was recovered.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to retrieve the emerald from the company's mine.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Cats Eye Emerald to Dizzywig.",["sourceHash"]="913e76d2b3053473cb81ee53c29ef2cfd1bfb8f63ef5880bd76953676545d9ad",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[897]={["aftermath"]="Jorn agreed that it did not belong, but could not determine its nature after its spirit had fled.",["atomIDs"]={"897:description:1-115","897:objective:1-43"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"897:completion:1-72","897:completion:74-127","897:completion:129-180","897:completion:185-279"},["opening"]="The insect-like creature seemed foreign to the Barrens' natural order. Its head might let Jorn judge what had appeared in the land.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring the strange creature's head to Jorn.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Harvester's head to Jorn.",["sourceHash"]="cf91028d6009c6082b9799da7acfef9eb0f625940edc8c7174d159b175295227",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[898]={["aftermath"]="Brightsun learned that a crewman thought long dead had survived.",["atomIDs"]={"898:description:1-8","898:description:10-30","898:description:35-74","898:description:76-127","898:description:129-184","898:description:186-234","898:description:243-286","898:description:288-359","898:description:364-375","898:description:377-413","898:description:415-469","898:objective:1-71"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"898:completion:1-49","898:completion:54-133"},["opening"]="Gilthares said he was the sole survivor when Theramore sank his transport. Imprisoned as an enemy, the former deckhand sought a protected escape to Ratchet.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to escort Gilthares back to Brightsun.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought Gilthares safely back to Ratchet.",["sourceHash"]="649453e4fc2fc65d4c490ade970527457cd3774085741c564ba0b8803b47f3c6",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[899]={["aftermath"]="Mankrik welcomed evidence of the quilboars' suffering, while admitting that his desire for revenge remained.",["atomIDs"]={"899:description:1-58","899:description:60-186","899:description:188-288","899:description:290-372","899:description:377-404","899:description:409-418","899:description:420-443","899:description:445-510","899:objective:1-65"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"899:completion:1-57","899:completion:62-174"},["opening"]="Mankrik's watch for quilboar had become an unrelenting demand for revenge. He asked for a great heap of tusks from the Bristlebacks.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather sixty Bristleback tusks.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the tusks to Mankrik.",["sourceHash"]="f137ccc7d1f516fe9a47743a8c594e2da4d08526c5ab53c11bbd99853c6e4347",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[900]={["aftermath"]="The lights dimmed and the apparatus's switch became movable, allowing shutdown.",["atomIDs"]={"900:description:1-46","900:description:48-173","900:objective:1-116"},["bridge"]="At the console, three open valves kept the apparatus running. Fuel, regulator and main controls had to be closed before the machinery could be stopped.",["bridgeFrom"]=894,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"900:completion:1-72","900:completion:74-214"},["opening"]="The console readings suggested the apparatus could not stop while its three valves remained open. Fuel, regulator and main controls had to be closed first.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to close the valves and revisit the console.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} closed all three control valves.",["sourceHash"]="d12aabdd3cefd128a9692748aec31dbd54456c1422180a51ae5a247aa69cd753",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[901]={["aftermath"]="The red light went out and the terminal lost its remaining power.",["atomIDs"]={"901:description:1-112","901:description:114-205","901:objective:1-73"},["bridge"]="Stopping the apparatus left another obstacle: the locked panel. Sniggles held the key to the mechanism within.",["bridgeFrom"]=900,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"901:completion:1-57","901:completion:59-145"},["opening"]="The apparatus was deactivated, but its panel remained locked. Sniggles held the key needed to reach the mechanism inside.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to obtain Sniggles's key for the console.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} unlocked the console with the recovered key.",["sourceHash"]="eb92b37fd87de5b6d449950dab54e0878aa92e1e90f9ae1edce65560ffe31709",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[902]={["aftermath"]="Sputtervalve intended to examine it before sending it to the Tinkers' Union for further research.",["atomIDs"]={"902:description:1-172","902:description:174-254","902:description:256-289","902:objective:1-50"},["bridge"]="Beyond the panel lay wires, tubing and the device Sputtervalve wanted. Removing the samophlange would carry the company's experiment back to Ratchet.",["bridgeFrom"]=901,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"902:completion:1-10","902:completion:18-31","902:completion:33-36","902:completion:38-109","902:completion:111-204","902:completion:209-260"},["opening"]="Behind the opened panel, wires and tubing surrounded the sought device. The samophlange could finally be removed and carried to Ratchet.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take the recovered device to Sputtervalve.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the samophlange to Sputtervalve.",["sourceHash"]="9ed8e95795fe955aa32d8066aa57bf7c8c7142ea057eee4f6ca94d77e6b5c2df",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[903]={["atomIDs"]={"903:description:1-54","903:description:57-102","903:description:105-130","903:description:132-142","903:description:145-184","903:description:187-238","903:description:243-342","903:objective:1-86"},["opening"]="Sergra advanced the hunt into the tall grasses. Savannah prowlers offered a more dangerous test, capable of turning a careless hunter into prey.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to collect seven prowler claws.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the claws to Sergra.",["sourceHash"]="ed6fd7eebdaf2149998d15c9e233b4081740c4e40acdf1ca69a680fda1f03c15",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[905]={["aftermath"]="Sergra questioned her own severity and warned that this defilement might create more trouble than it resolved.",["atomIDs"]={"905:description:1-26","905:description:29-94","905:description:99-137","905:description:140-183","905:description:186-260","905:description:262-302","905:objective:1-49","905:objective:51-93","905:objective:95-139"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"905:completion:1-22","905:completion:24-70","905:completion:72-133","905:completion:139-207","905:completion:209-330","905:completion:336-430","905:completion:432-509"},["opening"]="Sergra sent the hunt beyond combat and into the raptors' nesting grounds. Feathers placed on three nests were intended as a challenge.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to place raptor feathers on all three nests.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Sergra's assignment at the scytheclaw nests.",["sourceHash"]="74670b4bda9b1a6d7c0f7ae043e4109a26cb1e7eab5347b4e93baa05869daa52",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[906]={["aftermath"]="Thork acknowledged the raiders' leader and admitted he had suspected a different quilboar.",["atomIDs"]={"906:description:1-47","906:description:49-192","906:description:194-259","906:description:261-267","906:description:272-364","906:description:366-386","906:objective:1-60"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"906:completion:1-59","906:completion:61-68","906:completion:73-135","906:completion:137-204","906:completion:209-299","906:completion:301-320"},["opening"]="Mangletooth sent Lok's skull onward to Thork. He expected the evidence to speak for itself even if the Horde would doubt his part in the affair.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take Lok's skull to Thork.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Lok's skull at the Crossroads.",["sourceHash"]="682a691621cc5c45db58e4e5213693894e9b8cd7650aff816e92ab3aa134abe1",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[907]={["atomIDs"]={"907:description:1-49","907:description:52-127","907:description:130-222","907:description:227-284","907:description:287-345","907:description:348-387","907:objective:1-61"},["opening"]="Jorn's next lesson followed the heavy tread of southern thunder lizards. Their size made each step dangerous as the hunt moved among stormsnouts, stormhides and thunderheads.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather three samples of thunder lizard blood.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the blood to Jorn.",["sourceHash"]="6cb94cc1fe5e40bd13de453b0c142d1046a7de1a26afb84f241e899609960a7f",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[910]={["atomIDs"]={"910:description:1-79","910:description:82-160","910:description:163-215","910:description:218-222","910:description:227-277","910:description:280-402","910:description:405-409","910:objective:1-54"},["opening"]="Stories of ocean voyages filled the ward with hopes of becoming a Horde sailor. A visit to Ratchet's docks would supply the boats and sea air behind those imagined adventures.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to take the ward to Ratchet's docks.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the ward's visit to the Ratchet docks.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="0fa583aeb69c434451ec3d9c7c73992946e9fe387c798533e1437c1ea816ca50",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[911]={["atomIDs"]={"911:description:1-111","911:description:114-205","911:description:208-319","911:description:324-415","911:description:418-485","911:objective:1-107"},["opening"]="The ward pictured frontier life at Mor'shan, a gateway toward Ashenvale and future conflict. The child wanted to see the rampart where those martial stories met the edge of the forest.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to take the ward to Mor'shan Rampart.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the ward's visit to Mor'shan Rampart.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="8c39ab0cd31633dec7c3c6084e5cd1d38a5923d35c84d10f3f896d2e3620d16d",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[913]={["aftermath"]="Jorn closed his lessons by describing hunting as a path that continued throughout life.",["atomIDs"]={"913:description:1-39","913:description:42-73","913:description:76-161","913:description:166-214","913:objective:1-78"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"913:completion:1-43","913:completion:45-139","913:completion:144-172","913:completion:174-292","913:completion:297-323"},["opening"]="Jorn's instruction approached its close with a hunt for the fierce thunderhawk. Its wings were the proof he requested before the path turned onward.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring thunderhawk wings to Jorn.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the wings to Jorn.",["sourceHash"]="6d41df22017534d62d6a7a153b766be843dc0668a543b8a0fcbabde47def7327",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[915]={["atomIDs"]={"915:description:1-10","915:description:13-69","915:description:72-206","915:description:209-259","915:description:264-396","915:description:399-405","915:description:408-421","915:description:424-479","915:objective:1-44","915:objective:47-105"},["opening"]="A memory of the Shimmering Flats brought a simpler request from the ward. Tigule and Foror's strawberry ice cream was the favorite, and rumor put it on sale in town.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to find Strawberry Ice Cream for the ward.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied the ward with the requested Strawberry Ice Cream.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="336cb78b5f01ea52ce771850f859a062cc458f5a2ac7e830c205f03fb06464e6",["sourceMapID"]="?",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[918]={["atomIDs"]={"918:description:1-55","918:description:58-141","918:description:146-210","918:description:215-261","918:description:264-371","918:description:374-461","918:objective:1-53"},["opening"]="Teldrassil's timberlings reflected the tree's natural order, making their growing anger troubling to Denalan. He suspected the soil and wanted seeds from around Lake Al'Ameth for experiments in nurturing them.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather eight Timberling Seeds for Denalan.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered eight Timberling Seeds to Denalan.",["sourceHash"]="e8fcf02978bcd602bdce702c32e0441acc70bab3a0bef3e0963dd46c5e3bd28b",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[920]={["atomIDs"]={"920:description:12-56","920:description:58-108","920:description:113-184","920:objective:1-58"},["opening"]="Gilshalan had heard Tenaron asking for a visitor. The summons led upward through Aldrassil to the highest room above Shadowglen.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to speak with Tenaron Stormgrip atop Aldrassil.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} answered the summons by speaking with Tenaron Stormgrip.",["sourceHash"]="fc6d00e4a35a2ddfb531e647af1017f948ef20ed443ced97129bb5ba40544393",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
