[927]={["atomIDs"]={"927:description:1-67","927:description:70-149","927:description:151-181","927:description:186-229","927:objective:1-56"},["opening"]="Blackmoss's heart was almost unrecognizable beneath dark, oily moss, yet it continued to beat. The strange specimen might give Denalan something worth studying.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring the Moss-twined Heart to Denalan.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Moss-twined Heart to Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth.",["sourceHash"]="490e65fafa9bb847d82b3f9873e3e9cadc99d65d40632ce6d23b0f10116cfcea",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[930]={["atomIDs"]={"930:description:1-78","930:description:83-138","930:objective:1-52"},["opening"]="A large fruit hung beneath the fronds of a glowing plant. It offered another unusual specimen for Denalan's work at Lake Al'Ameth.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring the Glowing Fruit to Denalan.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Glowing Fruit to Denalan.",["sourceHash"]="dead6bf2b718815181527cf01c761f82a9cbbf54d27e8b70b98b961ef6092a0d",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[931]={["atomIDs"]={"931:description:1-89","931:description:94-148","931:objective:1-52"},["opening"]="Shimmering fronds gave a forest plant a twisting, pulsing appearance. A specimen could be carried to Denalan for study beside Lake Al'Ameth.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to take a Shimmering Frond to Denalan.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered a Shimmering Frond to Denalan.",["sourceHash"]="272970244ec827f3557fafae46cf61b0878c0b184558bc50bfb118b4640c403e",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[932]={["atomIDs"]={"932:description:1-54","932:description:56-150","932:description:155-180","932:description:182-277","932:description:279-340","932:description:345-434","932:objective:1-72"},["opening"]="Tallonkai wanted the matter of Lord Melenas kept quiet. The satyr had gathered grell warriors in Fel Rock north of Dolanaar, uncomfortably close to home, and Tallonkai demanded his head.",["pending"]="{actor} would confront Lord Melenas and bring his head to Tallonkai.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the assignment against Lord Melenas and delivered his head to Tallonkai.",["sourceHash"]="f8f87fedfe8bfb5a4f74e72ececf50b6ac58a6f08047e1ed0a7e0989acaef35f",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[936]={["aftermath"]="He welcomed the help while making the danger of the work clear.",["atomIDs"]={"936:description:1-66","936:description:71-212","936:description:215-334","936:description:339-440","936:objective:1-56"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"936:completion:1-70","936:completion:72-192","936:completion:194-233","936:completion:235-328"},["opening"]="Gryshka referred seasoned travelers to a research project whose specifics she did not know. Hamuul on Elder Rise would explain the Circle's need directly.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to meet Hamuul about his research.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached the archdruid.",["sourceHash"]="f76dbb103f08eb26de24af5524e0e6a4a76ba56587a89fc7d0ab26d2cd77a271",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[938]={["atomIDs"]={"938:description:1-85","938:description:87-194","938:description:199-277","938:description:279-310","938:objective:1-81"},["opening"]="The gray sabercat Mist lay badly wounded, her fur blending with the forest around her. She seemed willing to follow a guide to the sentinel at the Oracle Tree's moonwell.",["pending"]="{actor} would escort Mist to Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Mist's escort to Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak.",["sourceHash"]="65a8ce0af67473cccf233ff7af617d376abd2fe0770a88b9ce1c20186b3b46bf",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[939]={["aftermath"]="Eridan sensed ancient suffering so strongly that holding the objects was almost unbearable.",["atomIDs"]={"939:description:1-72","939:description:77-222","939:description:224-261","939:description:266-331","939:description:336-405","939:description:407-488","939:objective:1-97"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"939:completion:1-44","939:completion:49-91"},["opening"]="The flute's wooden spirals seemed to move beneath examination, suggesting something beyond an ordinary instrument. Other satyrs might carry related evidence for Eridan in southern Felwood.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring the flute and five felbind samples.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the objects to Eridan.",["sourceHash"]="721faa613a121201795d2e4336d7df946e397fb9c9a0f596767c1245fbe9058c",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[940]={["atomIDs"]={"940:description:1-47","940:description:49-174","940:description:176-288","940:description:293-396","940:objective:1-77"},["opening"]="Arynia entrusted the Oracle Tree's report to a messenger for Darnassus. She described a greater calm in the forest after the harpies were forced back and wanted the Arch Druid to receive the news.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to take the Oracle Tree's report to Fandral Staghelm.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Oracle Tree's report to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm.",["sourceHash"]="c3e53722988f2369fde66db7a89922013b641d2b7478b48add2f92180fdda9ee",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[941]={["aftermath"]="The heart dug into the planter's soil, then emerged cleansed moments later. Its slight pulse continued after the moss and taint were gone.",["atomIDs"]={"941:description:1-71","941:description:76-111","941:description:114-184","941:objective:1-45"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"941:completion:1-70","941:completion:75-125","941:completion:127-147","941:completion:149-177"},["opening"]="Removing the moss had not cleansed the heart. Denalan proposed placing it in his planter, where nourishing soil might offer a means of healing the remaining taint.",["pending"]="{actor} would plant the Tainted Heart in Denalan's Planter.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} placed the Tainted Heart in Denalan's Planter.",["sourceHash"]="6ab9e02d7e6f179b37aa3be6c645d168c50416f7a714a078425791a64476d308",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[942]={["atomIDs"]={"942:description:1-72","942:description:74-169","942:description:171-237","942:description:242-368","942:description:370-414","942:description:416-461","942:description:466-509","942:objective:1-73"},["opening"]="Greywhisker recognized a resemblance to a fossil Flagongut once displayed at an Explorers' League conference. Flagongut believed such a specimen held hidden power; his last known stop was Menethil's Deepwater Tavern.",["pending"]="{actor} would show Remtravel's mysterious fossil to Flagongut in Menethil.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the mysterious fossil to Archaeologist Flagongut.",["sourceHash"]="d3f8f9083cfacb1d096164b6d8d4e0dba82ece5e4fbfedf5ea50c7fcb3e4d99f",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[943]={["atomIDs"]={"943:description:1-77","943:description:79-182","943:description:187-281","943:description:283-418","943:description:423-488","943:objective:1-107"},["opening"]="Flagongut's original fossil was with Whelgar, but the Stone of Relu he thought might unlock its mystery was lost in a raptor attack. He needed both objects brought together before he could pursue that theory.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover the Stone of Relu and Flagongut's Fossil.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Stone of Relu and Flagongut's Fossil to Archaeologist Flagongut.",["sourceHash"]="0531af0818bd0e5fc19b41482dc3c1421d10fc39a92c4cf16dc34252ce80380c",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[944]={["atomIDs"]={"944:description:1-51","944:description:54-100","944:description:103-153","944:description:156-179","944:description:184-257","944:description:262-315","944:description:320-346","944:description:349-416","944:description:419-452","944:objective:1-75","944:objective:78-108"},["opening"]="Onu found the Twilight's Hammer presence stranger than the naga in Darkshore. Their worship pointed toward old defeated lords, and the Master's Glaive marked a place where one fell; a search and a scrying bowl could keep Onu informed.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to investigate the Master's Glaive and speak with Onu through a Scrying Bowl.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the investigation and scrying-bowl consultation with Onu.",["sourceHash"]="43b6e97bdb0c66c2f11c9040830dcdda01da183b6b3644e90dc6b8cea495cb9e",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[945]={["atomIDs"]={"945:description:1-5","945:description:10-92","945:description:95-120","945:description:125-152","945:description:155-219","945:description:222-279","945:objective:1-91"},["opening"]="Cultists surrounded Therylune while she wandered the Master's Glaive. She had stayed hidden, but needed help escaping and a message of safety taken to her sister at Ashenvale's Shrine of Aessina.",["pending"]="{actor} would help Therylune escape and inform Therysil.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Therylune's escape assignment and told Therysil that her sister was safe.",["sourceHash"]="4fa2e99763e993957e30829b749b9429e9d5ef050207b181fc07e764e37d4db7",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[947]={["atomIDs"]={"947:description:1-96","947:description:99-189","947:description:194-294","947:description:297-385","947:description:390-429","947:description:432-497","947:objective:1-74"},["opening"]="Barithras needed mushrooms from the cave behind Cliffspring Falls. The Grove of the Ancients had warned him away from an evil sensed there, so the collection had to also test that warning.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to gather five Scaber Stalks and one Death Cap while scouting the cave.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought five Scaber Stalks and one Death Cap to Barithras Moonshade.",["sourceHash"]="b50ced2e576c0bacb7e405c54329de95f23989f617f041ea8298134a157d5cb1",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[948]={["atomIDs"]={"948:description:1-125","948:description:128-183","948:description:188-225","948:description:228-320","948:objective:1-44"},["opening"]="Onu had heard of the journey to the falls and requested a meeting. Barithras feared that an Ancient of Lore seeking a traveler's account signaled an urgent concern.",["pending"]="{actor} would meet Onu at the Grove of the Ancients.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Onu at the Grove of the Ancients.",["sourceHash"]="5bb8d121a8b54faf4f1aa9ac94c25e63b45636a9a2fc3733e0d58c47c08ddf08",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[949]={["atomIDs"]={"949:description:1-68","949:description:71-90","949:description:95-136","949:description:138-194","949:description:199-255","949:objective:1-65"},["opening"]="The cult's purpose at the Master's Glaive remained unknown. Before a response could be planned, something in the Twilight camp had to reveal its intentions.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to search the Twilight's Hammer camp for a clue.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the search for a clue in the Twilight camp.",["sourceHash"]="484d6dc8a257c00e253213666d7452d6858873c6c75e7ae7ab5b60a5b4456521",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
